    "title": "SteeringContent provider (bundled-resource read + empty/missing guard)",
    "summary": "Add SteeringContent with steeringBody(): String that reads the bundled /insrc/steering-block.md via getResourceAsStream, trims it, and throws IllegalStateException when the resource is null or trims to empty. The resource stream accessor is injectable so it is unit-testable with present/missing/empty fakes. Read-only, independent of daemon install state.",
